    {
      "source": "Creates new zero based offset. <br/>\n<b>NOTE:</b> change to type based offset by calling <a href=\"#multipliedByTypeLength()\"><code>multipliedByTypeLength()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建新的基于零的偏移量。<br/>\n<b>注意：</b> 通过调用<a href=\"#multipliedByTypeLength()\"><code>multipliedByTypeLength()</code></a>将其更改为基于类型的偏移量。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Offset used inside a <a href=\"BitFieldSubCommands.BitFieldSubCommand.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>BitFieldSubCommands.BitFieldSubCommand</code></a>. Can be zero or type based. See\n<a href=\"https://redis.io/commands/bitfield#bits-and-positional-offsets\">Bits and positional offsets</a> in the\nRedis reference.",
      "translation": "在 <a href=\"BitFieldSubCommands.BitFieldSubCommand.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>BitFieldSubCommands.BitFieldSubCommand</code></a> 内部使用的偏移量。可以是零或基于类型的偏移量。请参见 Redis 参考中的\n<a href=\"https://redis.io/commands/bitfield#bits-and-positional-offsets\">位和位置偏移量</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
